# CIVIC CENTER LEDGE (Tour level 6): low granite ledges round Civic Center Plaza's lawns. From the path
# at the north-west corner, an ollie onto the first and a 50-50 along it until it stalls:
# FS 50-50 + CIVIC CENTER LEDGE.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport 70.56 432.94 3.6 172.4
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x 0.6143
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y -4.6395
hold ollie 0..20
tap grind 22..355 every 6
bot balance
run 420
expect event grindStart{line=ledge_71_432_b} within 21..25
expect event gap{id=civic_ledge,gap=CIVIC CENTER LEDGE,points=200} within 358..364
expect no event bail
